## Use when

Products that want trust through calm: developer tools that sell on taste, consumer AI, anything priced on quality rather than features.

## Avoid when

Dense dashboards, or anything that must feel fast and aggressive. Serif plus slow motion reads as considered, not urgent.

Measured on: Jog, Era, Handwired.

Its techniques are written up in full at https://artbook.dev/library/artbook.md

Rules: Rebuild from these measurements, never from a real site's code, text, logos or imagery. A font in <angle brackets> is a placeholder: pick a licensed face of that kind. Respect prefers-reduced-motion.
